## Interface: 120100
## Title: GideonRaid
## Notes: Helps pairing players with complementary debuffs and running the Entombed Sentinels intermission. Integrated with the GIDEON Discord bot. Bilingual in game: English by default, French on a frFR client (/gr lang).
## Notes-frFR: Aide a l'appariement et a l'intermission (Entombed Sentinels). Ne lit aucune API de combat. Bilingue en jeu : anglais par defaut, francais sur client frFR (/gr lang).
